Djalumo Agro
Copyright (c) 2026 Franck Junior Djandja Tomwa. All rights reserved.

This repository is public so that the work can be seen and assessed.
It is not open source.

1. What this covers

The source code, the Season Planner engine and its knowledge base, the
research notes and compiled data, the English and French texts, the field
photographs, the maps and charts, the Djalumo and Djalumo Agro names and
logos, and every other file in this repository, unless a file or section 4
below says otherwise.

2. What you may do

You may view this repository and read its code and content in order to
assess the work. The GitHub Terms of Service also let GitHub users view and
fork public repositories on GitHub. That permission does not grant any of
the rights reserved in section 3.

3. What you may not do without prior written permission

Copy, reproduce, modify, publish, distribute, sell, sublicense or host the
code, content, data, photographs or brand assets, in whole or in part; use
them to build, run or train a product, a service or a model; or use the
Djalumo or Djalumo Agro names and logos.

4. Third party components

Libraries, fonts and datasets made by others keep their own licences: the
npm packages listed in package.json (each package carries its licence), the
Manrope typeface under the SIL Open Font License (lib/report/fonts/OFL.txt)
and the Natural Earth geography distributed through the world-atlas package.
Figures quoted from public sources belong to their publishers and are cited
where they are used.

5. Permissions

To ask for a licence, a partnership or any use not allowed above, contact
the author through the contact page of the Djalumo Agro website or through
GitHub (https://github.com/franckdjandja).

6. No warranty

The software and its content are provided "as is", without warranty of any
kind. The Season Planner gives indicative estimates; it is not financial,
investment or agronomic advice.


